---
// Systems & open source — Elemento UI and the Pandora AI-native system.
---

<section id="systems">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head" data-reveal>
      <div class="k i18n" data-en="Systems and open source" data-pt="Sistemas e open source">
        Systems and open source
      </div>
      <h2
        class="i18n"
        data-en="Tools I build <em>for the craft.</em>"
        data-pt="Ferramentas que construo <em>pelo ofício.</em>"
      >
        Tools I build <em>for the craft.</em>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="sys-grid">
      <div class="sys" data-reveal>
        <div class="toprow">
          <span class="sname">Elemento UI</span>
          <span class="badge i18n" data-en="Coming soon" data-pt="Em breve">Coming soon</span>
        </div>
        <p
          class="i18n"
          data-en="An open-source design system I'm building. Components in Figma and Tailwind, inspired by shadcn/ui, so a project can look considered from the first commit."
          data-pt="Um design system open-source que estou construindo. Componentes em Figma e Tailwind, inspirado no shadcn/ui, pra um projeto já nascer bem resolvido desde o primeiro commit."
        >
          An open-source design system I'm building. Components in Figma and Tailwind, inspired by
          shadcn/ui, so a project can look considered from the first commit.
        </p>
        <div class="code">figma + tailwind + react</div>
      </div>

      <div class="sys" data-reveal>
        <div class="toprow">
          <span class="sname">Pandora</span>
          <span class="badge neutral i18n" data-en="Personal R&amp;D" data-pt="P&amp;D pessoal">Personal R&D</span>
        </div>
        <p
          class="i18n"
          data-en="A self-improving, AI-native knowledge system. A multi-agent workflow with shared memory, semantic search, and safety guards that researches, plans, and reviews alongside me so I ship faster."
          data-pt="Um sistema de conhecimento AI-native que se aprimora sozinho. Um workflow multi-agente com memória compartilhada, busca semântica e guardas de segurança que pesquisa, planeja e revisa comigo pra eu entregar mais rápido."
        >
          A self-improving, AI-native knowledge system. A multi-agent workflow with shared memory,
          semantic search, and safety guards that researches, plans, and reviews alongside me so I
          ship faster.
        </p>
        <div class="code">agents + markdown + retrieval</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
